correction('P000827','Cartan/Serre index convention','[h_beta,e_alpha]=n_(alpha,beta)e_alpha but exponent1-n_(alpha,beta)','with that bracket convention, exponent1-n_(beta,alpha)','Scan confirms inconsistent ordering; root-string length uses action of h_alpha on e_beta. Factor2 in[e,f] is only a rescaling.')
correction('P000828','loop realization','affine algebra equals g tensor Laurent polynomials','center quotient of derived affine algebra; restore central extension/full Cartan when needed','The preceding kernel-of-A line gives a nonzero center, whereas simple-g loop algebra has zero center.')
